.TH runglass 1 2026-05-28 "runglass 0.3.1" "RunGlass Manual"
.SH NAME
runglass \- Run any command. Get a receipt for what changed.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrunglass\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run any command. Get a receipt for what changed.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
runglass\-run(1)
Run one command and create a receipt
.TP
runglass\-open(1)
Open a receipt in the local browser UI
.TP
runglass\-review(1)
Review a saved receipt and choose keep/revert/export/open actions
.TP
runglass\-ci(1)
Run one command in CI and write receipt artifacts
.TP
runglass\-report(1)
.TP
runglass\-list(1)
.TP
runglass\-export(1)
.TP
runglass\-doctor(1)
Check local collector readiness and receipt storage
.TP
runglass\-validate(1)
Validate a saved receipt or CI receipt directory
.TP
runglass\-snapshot(1)
.TP
runglass\-prune(1)
.TP
runglass\-delete(1)
.TP
runglass\-github(1)
Detect GitHub context and post PR receipt comments
.TP
runglass\-pr\-comment(1)
Post or preview a compact RunGlass receipt comment on a pull request
.TP
runglass\-revert(1)
.TP
runglass\-demo(1)
.SH VERSION
v0.3.1
